('N2-L-INTEGRATED-001-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-001', 1, '居酒屋でも料理が選べるコースを頼めば', '[{"start":0,"end":3,"answer":"いざかや","accept":["居酒屋","いざかや"]},{"start":11,"end":14,"answer":"コース","accept":["コース"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-001-d1.mp3', 'ced63a9296ececa7986cb28599fcb1c1d66818659de02a60c468edc510f13196', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-002-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-002', 1, '名前を入れてもらえる物にすれば', '[{"start":0,"end":2,"answer":"なまえ","accept":["名前"]},{"start":10,"end":11,"answer":"もの","accept":["物","もの"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-002-d1.mp3', 'e6b175535de73ec3f892ab3bb0d234b37402debc1bf6ea6989b6a379353a7dfb', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-003-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-003', 1, '食事の後に簡単なゲームをするのはどうですか。', '[{"start":0,"end":2,"answer":"しょくじ","accept":["食事","しょくじ"]},{"start":8,"end":11,"answer":"ゲーム","accept":["ゲーム"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-003-d1.mp3', '58063961bb13054840d08433c633f0bf958e1f5a2f4d665373d754ed21fa84b3', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-004-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-004', 1, '食事が評判の旅館に問い合わせてみましょう', '[{"start":0,"end":2,"answer":"しょくじ","accept":["食事","しょくじ"]},{"start":9,"end":14,"answer":"といあわせ","accept":["問い合わせ"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-004-d1.mp3', 'dabff42c3c982c0ee70a40d13f792ea042789d5eb03dd47615a547e877445dd0', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-005-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-005', 1, '省エネ機能の付いた新品を一台買いましょう。', '[{"start":0,"end":3,"answer":"しょうえね","accept":["省エネ"]},{"start":3,"end":5,"answer":"きのう","accept":["機能"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-005-d1.mp3', '3157eea0d71ab84ea3c983c1af3e1fb31b4911bc116146290dbf097c53461539', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-006-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-006', 1, 'ソファーとテーブルを買うことにしましょう', '[{"start":0,"end":4,"answer":"ソファー","accept":["ソファー"]},{"start":5,"end":9,"answer":"テーブル","accept":["テーブル"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-006-d1.mp3', '8c0cc764fc0bbb52106f4e9f7d1f802a13f76128dad5b8bec4e258450fac2bdd', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-007-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-007', 1, '山道が滑りやすくなって危ないです。', '[{"start":11,"end":14,"answer":"あぶない","accept":["危ない","あぶない"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-007-d1.mp3', 'a1d119f89eadc51a63ab82f88a84098b374ef03fbae229792ffe0b0afcd8145a', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-008-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-008', 1, 'アルバムにまとめて渡しましょう', '[{"start":0,"end":4,"answer":"アルバム","accept":["アルバム"]},{"start":11,"end":15,"answer":"ましょう","accept":["ましょう"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-008-d1.mp3', '355cc4093d7622e6dda7e38a5bfc09f3ea67b44bf1d98f4ba0e4ed1fe3d7117b', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-009-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-009', 1, '管理人さんが常駐している物件が候補にあります。', '[{"start":0,"end":3,"answer":"かんりにん","accept":["管理人"]},{"start":6,"end":8,"answer":"じょうちゅう","accept":["常駐"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-009-d1.mp3', '132ebd9bc8b7804a4960b11a39164f2120e62559b11d227b9c092da927359ef8', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-010-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-010', 1, '子ども用の席もある中華料理店が空いていました。', '[{"start":0,"end":3,"answer":"こども","accept":["子ども","こども"]},{"start":9,"end":14,"answer":"ちゅうかりょうりてん","accept":["中華料理店"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-010-d1.mp3', 'b25615536e6dca3d7ed48eb6662adccf5fb362e49970b7ce1df0b1ebad4932c9', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-011-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-011', 1, '何冊かまとめて贈りましょう', '[{"start":4,"end":7,"answer":"とめて","accept":["とめて"]},{"start":9,"end":13,"answer":"ましょう","accept":["ましょう"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-011-d1.mp3', '54c330a9e0d437da97341f40ad970612e3b025c89b1b117d135f162d3a71f1a7', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-012-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-012', 1, '猫との相性も見てから決めましょう', '[{"start":0,"end":1,"answer":"ねこ","accept":["猫","ねこ"]},{"start":12,"end":16,"answer":"ましょう","accept":["ましょう"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-012-d1.mp3', 'c93098f44719cf6f91ecfa2841256436656c5408ab5cb26345971878a9c6a90f', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-013-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-013', 1, '質疑応答の時間を残すようにしましょう', '[{"start":0,"end":4,"answer":"しつぎおうとう","accept":["質疑応答"]},{"start":5,"end":7,"answer":"じかん","accept":["時間"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-013-d1.mp3', '7cd5c7d8c2fc317e13908fb9292f3d4b7edca9843b8c43571834092cd18e14ca', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-014-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-014', 1, '立ちっぱなしで大変です', '[{"start":0,"end":6,"answer":"たちっぱなし","accept":["立ちっぱなし"]},{"start":7,"end":11,"answer":"たいへんです","accept":["大変です"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-014-d1.mp3', 'fb481307fa8fdf77939613a92ee9cb985e192f09e8a5891b195a1c117d721cb2', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-015-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-015', 1, '一つの鍋でできます。', '[{"start":0,"end":2,"answer":"ひとつ","accept":["一つ"]},{"start":3,"end":4,"answer":"なべ","accept":["鍋","なべ"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-015-d1.mp3', '3b6bd14b0ae1fd5bd6f073df5c0c54953b458adb53aaeeb6d3de8d10ed95f8f7', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-016-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-016', 1, '個性が出にくいと思います', '[{"start":0,"end":2,"answer":"こせい","accept":["個性"]},{"start":8,"end":10,"answer":"おもい","accept":["思い"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-016-d1.mp3', '524c5fe566b2b7bedad95ed9204f42ed95a5da9cda5cffff6c9e977b614c0bf6', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-017-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-017', 1, '交流も深まります', '[{"start":0,"end":2,"answer":"こうりゅう","accept":["交流"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-017-d1.mp3', 'fe60386043aff8a6ffb1f5e6436fa7614b6db1087343fab5a0e14ea890cfcef0', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-018-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-018', 1, '近くの書店で買うほうが早いかもしれませんね。', '[{"start":0,"end":2,"answer":"ちかく","accept":["近く","ちかく"]},{"start":3,"end":5,"answer":"しょてん","accept":["書店"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-018-d1.mp3', '92df776d543833ac3eba12c2dce86699c3d5efeda446e2ab128f1024c5f36a0c', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-019-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-019', 1, '病気で入院したら足りなくなる恐れがあります。', '[{"start":0,"end":2,"answer":"びょうき","accept":["病気","びょうき"]},{"start":3,"end":5,"answer":"にゅういん","accept":["入院"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-019-d1.mp3', '533ed0659daa239cfaa1511fc1397195db4e3055f0feb98631aa674fd69e2ca3', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-020-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-020', 1, '朝のシフトなら空いているので、そこへ移れますよ。', '[{"start":0,"end":1,"answer":"あさ","accept":["朝","あさ"]},{"start":2,"end":5,"answer":"シフト","accept":["シフト"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-020-d1.mp3', '5e0ff34f1cc263b218b10e79adf4a496a2785f9f286f6c7ecfb444aab41fbe59', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-021-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-021', 1, '環境の変化も伝えられますね。', '[{"start":0,"end":2,"answer":"かんきょう","accept":["環境"]},{"start":3,"end":5,"answer":"へんか","accept":["変化"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-021-d1.mp3', '87eda5c8126eeb42d2ae5ad216994fe0a65dadb902b67153e92aa890f94ab829', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-022-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-022', 1, '省エネの新品が長い目では安いですよ。', '[{"start":0,"end":3,"answer":"しょうえね","accept":["省エネ"]},{"start":4,"end":6,"answer":"しんぴん","accept":["新品"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-022-d1.mp3', 'a9c4ef9430e67aa1a5aa14d31b9ec297417aab5e4656256e3f0183be7a7d65ca', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
('N2-L-INTEGRATED-023-D1', 'N2-L-INTEGRATED-023', 1, '事前に作れるお菓子を袋に詰めて売るのはどうですか。', '[{"start":0,"end":3,"answer":"じぜんに","accept":["事前に"]},{"start":6,"end":9,"answer":"おかし","accept":["お菓子","おかし"]}]', 'learning-path/N2/skills/N2-L-INTEGRATED-023-d1.mp3', 'b85767a9008992b3a2f14b930b8fb550ef7a94212a8f50e6a0ed9e581a9d5a64', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'cb68d1e3bccc'),
